# ---------- Local runner runtime output (C8-17) ----------
# The onevps-local-runner-scaffold CLI defaults to writing captured
# scope/scanner/manifest/bundle artifacts and its append-only attempt log
# under .codeattest/ relative to the current working directory. This is
# customer-local runtime output, not source, and must never be committed
# (real attempt logs contain customer actor metadata).
**/.codeattest/

